    "detailed_description": "After leaving Earth at the brink of the planet\u2019s destruction, mankind is on its way to conquer the space frontier\u2026 only for a hyperdrive malfunction to leave them stranded in the Consuello star system that doesn\u2019t have a single hard-surfaced planet.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRachel Reid is a space delivery worker, hauling goods from one asteroid to another. Despite her best efforts, the young woman is stuck in a lower managerial position and is having trouble earning a promotion. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nYet she is blessed with a sudden opportunity. She only needs to deliver seven urgent orders to finally move up on the corporate ladder, but it seems like the Universe stands in her way. What will Rachel do to get the position she\u2019s been dreaming of for so long? <br />\r\n<br />\r\nKirin Come is a SCI-FI Visual Novel. It tells a story of the events that happen in a forgotten corner of space during a twenty-year timespan and features a huge cast of characters. The protagonists, Rachel and Mary, are bound to change the Consuello system beyond recognition with their actions!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Incredible SCI-FI adventure!<br />\r\n- Excellent comedy<br />\r\n- Amazing artstyle and soundtracks<br />\r\n- Unique and peculiar world<br />\r\n- Colorful cast of characters<br />\r\n- Complex, well thought-out plot",
